--TEST--
an interface counts its implementations and a class its subclasses in a lens after the reference count, and a type nothing is below gets no second lens, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shape {}
class Square implements Shape {}
class Circle implements Shape {}
class Animal {}
class Dog extends Animal {}
--REQUEST--
codeLens
--EXPECT--
2:11 2 implementations -> case.nvs:3:7, case.nvs:4:7
2:11 2 references -> case.nvs:3:25, case.nvs:4:25
3:7 no references
4:7 no references
5:7 1 reference -> case.nvs:6:19
5:7 1 subclass -> case.nvs:6:7
6:7 no references
